        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a helpful, intelligent sales assistant. Your task is to take website research and turn it into a personalised cold email body that feels researched and tailored.\n\nHere is the prospect and company data:\nProfile: {{ $('Loop Over Items').first().json.first_name }} {{ $('Loop Over Items').first().json.last_name }} - {{ $('Loop Over Items').first().json.designation }} at {{ $('Loop Over Items').first().json.company }}\nHeadline: {{ $('Loop Over Items').first().json.headline }}\nWebsite research (one abstract per page):\n{{ $json.page_summaries.join(\"\\n\\n\") }}\n\nProduct Description: {{ $('Campaign Settings').first().json['About your Product'] }}\nProduct URL: {{ $('Campaign Settings').first().json['Product URL'] }}\nSender Name: {{ $('Campaign Settings').first().json['Your Name'] }}\n\nWrite a cold email to this prospect.\n- Open with a multi-line icebreaker built on non-obvious details from the website research: small but meaningful things that show real research.\n- Connect those details to the product's most relevant benefit for this company.\n- Keep the tone professional, concise and credible. Avoid fluff.\n- Avoid generic praise like \"Great website\" or \"Love your marketing.\"\n- Return only the email body, signed with the sender name."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
