    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# AI Website Scraper & Icebreaker\n*Apollo leads → Firecrawl website research → Gemini-written personalised cold emails*\n\n1. **Campaign Settings:** your name, product description and URL\n2. **Apollo:** search ICP prospects → unlock verified emails → keep leads with a company website (no Gmail)\n3. **Firecrawl:** crawl up to 3 pages of each prospect's site (async job, polled until it finishes)\n4. **Gemini:** summarise each page → combine → write a multi-line icebreaker + email body\n5. **Output:** append to Google Sheets, then email you when the batch is done\n\n## Setup\n- Install the community node `@mendable/n8n-nodes-firecrawl`\n- Credentials: Firecrawl, Google Gemini, Google Sheets, Gmail\n- Replace `YOUR_APOLLO_API_KEY`, `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`, `you@example.com` and fill in **Campaign Settings**\n- Edit the ICP filters in the **Scan Leads** request body",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1200,
        1568
      ],
      "id": "6127889c-5dfa-4c91-a11e-f0c88da1fa93",
      "name": "Overview"
